#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:5 ee792640e0714af68891f9f2a3bd4e70
msgid "Basic Tuning"
msgstr "基础调参"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:7 f07a598dcd024d318fcbd309df3dbc1c
msgid "this page superseded and is now ARCHIVED"
msgstr "本页已被取代，现已归档"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:9 1c1e4e63f97f4aedb4b503ec9bdee28a
msgid "This topic covers basic Roll and pitch and throttle tuning."
msgstr "本主题涵盖基本的横滚、俯仰和油门调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:12 6a1516cf1a394d8691829770b29dbb8f
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:14 9d3ad6c37b494b57b79cb1853887a023
msgid ""
"After your first flight, you may notice that you copter doesn't respond to "
"control inputs the way you want it to or you may have trouble maintaining "
"control of your copter. If you are familiar with PID controllers, check out "
"the :ref:`advanced tuning guide here <tuning>`. If you are an experienced "
"operator, try out :ref:`the autotune feature <autotune>`. This page will "
"cover the basic tuning section of Mission Planner and APM Planner that "
"simplified the complex tuning process into a few simple sliders. This is the"
" best tuning method for new operators."
msgstr ""
"第一次飞行后，您可能会注意到飞行器对控制输入的响应不如您所愿，或者您可能难以保持对飞行器的控制。如果您熟悉PID控制器，请查看 :ref:`高级调参指南"
" <tuning>`。如果您是有经验的操作者，可以尝试 :ref:`AutoTune功能 <autotune>`。本页将介绍Mission "
"Planner和APM Planner的基础调参部分，它将复杂的调参过程简化为几个简单的滑块。这是新手操作者最佳的调参方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:24 4695c08976204fafb34b9f7457083f73
msgid "Roll and pitch tuning"
msgstr "横滚和俯仰调参"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:26 bbf3bb20f4fb400db0938c51576231ae
msgid ""
"Tuning is easiest at the field using a :ref:`telemetry radio <common-"
"telemetry-landingpage>`. Perform an initial flight with the following "
"questions in mind:"
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`数传电台 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 在飞行现场调参最为方便。在进行初次飞行时，请思考以下问题："

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:29 063d9461a4d042a3ad68b7db50e193f7
msgid ""
"How does the copter respond to roll and pitch? Is the response more sluggish"
" or twitchy than you want?"
msgstr "飞行器对横滚和俯仰控制的响应如何？响应是否比您想要的更迟钝或更抽动？"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:31 d49b2694b0ab43f3a756ff8dba98beee
msgid ""
"When the copter is hover, what level is the throttle set at? Does it hover "
"at the middle position of the stick or is it above or below the center "
"position?"
msgstr "飞行器悬停时，油门设置在什么水平？它是在摇杆中间位置悬停，还是高于或低于中心位置？"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:34 f55831396d604594ab0271634d0e5391
msgid ""
"When raising the throttle, what rate does the copter accelerate at? Does it "
"gain altitude more slowly or more quickly than you want?"
msgstr "推高油门时，飞行器的爬升速率是多少？它的爬升速度是比您想要的更慢还是更快？"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:37 b4b1dce332724028aeccb920532376bb
msgid ""
"Connect the telemetry radio ground module to your ground station computer "
"and open either Mission Planner or APM Planner. Select the correct COM port "
"and select Connect. You should see live data on the Flight Data screen. To "
"begin tuning, select Config/Tuning and Basic Tuning."
msgstr ""
"将数传电台地面模块连接到地面站计算机，打开Mission Planner或APM "
"Planner，选择正确的COM口并连接。您应该能在飞行数据界面看到实时数据。开始调参，选择Config/Tuning和Basic Tuning。"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:43 b7783e6e1ec944edbdf4f5cc8a0457f6
msgid ""
"Start with the Roll/Pitch slider at the top of the page. If you observed "
"that your copter was too twitchy in response to roll and pitch controls, "
"move the slider one tick mark to the left, or, if you observed that your "
"copter was too sluggish, move the slider one tick mark to the right. Repeat "
"your flight to determine if the change was beneficial. Repeat the process "
"until you are satisfied with the way your copter responds to roll and pitch."
msgstr ""
"从页面顶部的横滚/俯仰滑块开始。如果您观察到飞行器对横滚和俯仰控制响应过于抽动，将滑块向左移动一个刻度；如果响应过于迟钝，则向右移动一个刻度。重复飞行以确定该调整是否有效。重复此过程直到您对飞行器的横滚和俯仰响应满意。"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:58 bc432a24ca3945cda95537fcb8b62779
msgid "Throttle tuning"
msgstr "油门调参"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:60 decd9d3a626941f48723fd4f03c92113
msgid ""
"The bottom two sliders allows you to tune the throttle control. Adjust the "
"slider marked Throttle Hover until the copter hovers at the throttle stick's"
" middle position. If the copter hovers with the throttle stick above middle "
"position, move the slider to the left by one tick-mark until it hovers at "
"mid-stick, testing as you go. If the copter hovers with the throttle stick "
"below middle position, move the slider to the right by single tick-mark "
"increments until it does. Make sure to test each set of tuning settings as "
"you go."
msgstr ""
"底部两个滑块用于调整油门控制。调整标有\"油门悬停\"的滑块，直到飞行器在油门摇杆中间位置悬停。如果飞行器在油门摇杆高于中间位置时悬停，将滑块向左移动一个刻度，直到其在中间摇杆位置悬停，边测试边调整。如果飞行器在油门摇杆低于中间位置时悬停，将滑块向右移动一个刻度，直到达到效果。每次调整都要进行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/basic-tuning.rst:69 329e1bd32dfb4fc6b91ce646064b3a04
msgid ""
"Move the slider marked Throttle Accel or Climb Sensitivity to the right to "
"have the copter gain altitude more aggressively or to the left to have the "
"copter gain altitude more gently. Test each increment after setting to "
"evaluate the tune."
msgstr "将标有\"油门加速\"或\"爬升灵敏度\"的滑块向右移动，使飞行器更激进地上升高度；向左移动则使飞行器更柔和地上升高度。每次调整后进行测试以评估效果。"
